  "texts": {
    "preamble": "B Satyanarayana Naidu vs The State Of Ap on 5 July, 2019 Author: M. Satyanarayana Murthy Bench: M. Satyanarayana Murthy Honourable Sri Justice M. Satyanarayana Murthy Criminal Petition No.13995 of 2014 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings, in C.C.No.1402 of 2012, on the file of the Additional Judicial First Class Magistrate, Tiruvuru, for the offences under Section 7(i), 2(ia) (k) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954, R/w Rule 55 of PFA Rules, 1955, punishable under Section 16(1-A)(i) of PFA Act, 1954.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner raises a specific ground of non- compliance of Section 16(1-A)(i) of PFA Act, 1954, submitted that this issue is squarely covered by the judgment of the High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the State of Telangana and State of Andhra Pradesh, in Criminal Petition No.15767 of 2013, dated 28.07.2014.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner raises a specific ground of non- compliance of Section 16(1-A)(i) of PFA Act, 1954, submitted that this issue is squarely covered by the judgment of the High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the State of Telangana and State of Andhra Pradesh, in Criminal Petition No.15767 of 2013, dated 28.07.2014.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
